WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.200
There is the scene, and then there is your reaction.

2
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.400
Switch to Video.

3
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:10.000
Open More next to the shutter.

4
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.400
Choose Picture-in-Picture in Layout.

5
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:15.000
Check the framing of both camera views.

6
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Tap the red button to record.
